I do think it was a cool concept at first, like, as an arcade game.

00:32:49.600 --> 00:32:50.800
On paper. Right, right.

00:32:50.900 --> 00:32:54.560
Like, it felt like, oh, yeah, this would have definitely been one of those, like, things

